WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:10.150
Submit your fanart to the Soul Contract producers here at: soulcontractanime.tumblr.com/submit

00:01:47.487 --> 00:01:50.721
Soul Contract

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:55.362
16th Contract

00:01:56.754 --> 00:01:59.877
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:09.290
The sword is sealed once sheathed

00:02:09.298 --> 00:02:11.053
Unsheath then it gets unsealed

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:12.320
What does it mean?

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:13.370
Yang Jinghua

00:02:13.378 --> 00:02:15.627
I don't have any powers now

00:02:15.627 --> 00:02:18.504
You pierced me with the Luoye Sword

00:02:18.504 --> 00:02:20.940
My powers are sealed

00:02:20.956 --> 00:02:23.220
How can it be?

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.440
The answer

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.705
is in that book

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.300
Several hundred years ago,

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.010
there's a great master who pledged to save the world

00:02:38.015 --> 00:02:40.108
by forging the Luoye Sword

00:02:40.108 --> 00:02:41.984
The sword can take down deities

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:43.200
and subdue demons

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.540
It can calm evil spirits from all directions

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.040
It can impede a Yangming Master

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.840
Impede Yangming Master?

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.950
Yangming Masters are ordinary people

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:54.480
but our powers are exceedingly great

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.680
If there's any evil in our heart,

00:02:56.687 --> 00:02:59.110
what would happen to the world?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.264
Therefore,

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:04.220
when a Yangming Master falls into the evil path

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:05.520
Then the sword is used

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.060
to seal his power

00:03:07.061 --> 00:03:09.717
I got cut by the sword when I was young

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.100
but it only deteriorated my training

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:13.900
and I didn't lose my power

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:14.960
I believe

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.900
you may have the ability to conjure its powers

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:18.720
Me?

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.170
Why?

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.900
The Luoye's blacksmith master

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:24.340
is called Yangning Zicheng

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:28.840
He was an associate and first disciple of the Duanmu family's first Yangming Master

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.310
Zicheng?

00:03:30.314 --> 00:03:31.497
Luoye?

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:43.240
It was said that in order to stop Duanmu Luoye from massacring and turning evil

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.980
Yangning ripped off an arm to forge the sword

00:03:45.983 --> 00:03:47.015
When he was alive,

00:03:47.015 --> 00:03:49.264
he and the sword were never apart

00:03:49.264 --> 00:03:50.905
After he passed away,

00:03:50.905 --> 00:03:53.920
his disciple gave away the sword to Duanmu family

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.170
I guess

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.125
you

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.060
are the descendant of Yangning

00:03:58.060 --> 00:03:59.760
I heard about it since young

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.960
that my ancestors were great exorcists

00:04:01.968 --> 00:04:04.233
I always thought it was a made up story

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:05.340
You already knew

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.820
Is this why you chose me as your Soul Image?

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:08.500
No

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.020
Actually, I didn't know

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.900
That time, it was...

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.680
The sword is sealed once sheathed

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:15.340
Unsheath then it gets unsealed

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:16.260
That means

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.900
if I find the scabbard, your powers will return

00:04:18.905 --> 00:04:19.611
Alright

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:20.660
Once you recover

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.080
We'll look for the scabbard

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:22.930
It's impossible

00:04:23.983 --> 00:04:25.532
Because Luoye

00:04:25.532 --> 00:04:28.218
is a sword without a scabbard

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:34.080
Sifu

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.570
I recall that

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:37.340
the Luoye

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.920
never has a scabbard, right?

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:39.820
Yes

00:04:39.828 --> 00:04:41.546
Then why you still...

00:04:41.546 --> 00:04:43.701
It's the only way to resolve it

00:04:45.474 --> 00:04:47.866
Whether they can find it or not

00:04:47.866 --> 00:04:50.054
It all depends on fate

00:04:50.054 --> 00:04:51.121
Otherwise,

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.380
I hope they never find it

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:54.420
This way,

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.700
that kid will be freed from his circumstances

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.470
and be himself

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:00.960
This is also what you want too, isn't it?

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.180
Yin

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.600
Where to look for the scabbard?

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.280
You've been to my house

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.520
Even my parents' graves were repaired by me

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:16.940
There's nothing there

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.940
Perhaps it's always with you

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:20.690
You just don't realize it

00:05:21.591 --> 00:05:22.809
Let's go

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:23.940
To where?

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:25.130
Home

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.140
Master Situ

00:05:32.142 --> 00:05:33.937
Master Situ, please wait up

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:34.980
Step aside

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:36.660
I want to see Yangming Master

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:38.340
Yangming Master is not well

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.840
You can't see him

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:49.480
2nd Lady

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:50.600
2nd Lady, bad news

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:51.620
Quiet down

00:05:51.622 --> 00:05:52.762
What is it?

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.840
T-There's an intrusion at the front door

00:05:57.437 --> 00:05:59.906
I heard Yangming Master was badly wounded

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:02.320
We, the Situ family, come at night to pay a visit

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:03.020
What's wrong?

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:04.760
Won't let me see even his face?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:08.240
Is this how the Duanmu family treats the guests?

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.110
Calm down, Master Situ

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:11.360
Yangming Master is...

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.120
Young Master is badly injured

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:15.140
He needs rest to recover

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.720
Please leave

00:06:17.519 --> 00:06:21.570
I heard Yangming Master was attacked by Soul Image

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.140
I told you

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:25.060
That Soul Image should be removed

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:27.930
Your Master brought problems upon himself

00:06:27.939 --> 00:06:31.296
Our issue is none of your concern

00:06:31.296 --> 00:06:37.533
These past few days, Yangming Master requested me to investigate a spirit that absorbs demonic power

00:06:37.533 --> 00:06:39.891
This thing is extremely powerful

00:06:39.891 --> 00:06:42.475
I can only seal it temporary

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.560
Where is he?

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:44.740
I've told you already

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:46.120
He needs rest

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.740
Don't you get it?

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.320
You shouldn't talk this way

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:53.710
Your family has requested us to capture this spirit

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.000
We have done our part

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.260
We're obligated to come and inform you

00:06:57.265 --> 00:06:59.216
Sure, Yangming Master needs his rest

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:00.760
but this demon-seal talisman

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.340
can only last till dawn

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:04.560
By then, this evil being will escape

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:08.500
It will be difficult for the few of us, the Spirit Manipulators, to handle it

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.480
2nd Lady, why do you look so grim?

00:07:11.747 --> 00:07:12.817
Oh right

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:15.080
I heard a rumor when I come here

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.180
What rumor?

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.900
Yangming Master was stabbed by Luoye Sword

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.360
and lost his powers

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:22.600
Nonsense

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.240
Where's your proof

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:25.370
Siyun

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.660
Great grandma

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.320
Is it true?

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:38.100
Duanmu Xi

00:07:38.425 --> 00:07:39.752
I'm fine

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:41.330
We're almost home

00:07:41.331 --> 00:07:43.237
Once we get that thing

00:07:43.237 --> 00:07:45.299
My power will be restored

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:48.220
W-Why are you so concerned about your power?

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:50.080
Is it really that important?

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.370
I told you that

00:07:51.846 --> 00:07:55.363
it is equally feared and desired by the spirits

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.620
Many demons, ghosts, and youkais

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.840
are waiting for the moment when I'm weak

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:02.360
Then why don't you give up being a Yangming Master?

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:04.300
Sometimes I envy you

00:08:04.302 --> 00:08:07.064
You always think so simple

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:08.810
Yang Jinghua

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:12.040
There're things in this world far scarier than demons

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:14.190
It's the humans

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:15.100
Careful

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.400
Somebody's there

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:19.420
Siyun

00:08:19.429 --> 00:08:21.148
What's going on?

00:08:21.148 --> 00:08:23.133
Didn't Xi had an accident?

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.100
How did he turn out

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.480
getting stabbed by Luoye?

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.520
Great grandma

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.580
I was worried about your health

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:29.740
So I...

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:32.460
Tell me if it's true

00:08:32.460 --> 00:08:34.040
Brother Xi

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:37.440
was indeed stabbed by Luoye Sword used by Soul Image, Yang Jinghua

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:40.240
We are uncertain if he has lost his powers

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.360
I plead you

00:08:41.369 --> 00:08:43.338
not to listen to rumors

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.240
Whether it's a rumor or not

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:47.740
Please ask him to step forth and clarify

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:49.340
if he has truly lost his power

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.940
His post as Yangming Master

00:08:50.944 --> 00:08:52.695
and also as a household master,

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.280
would be in a predicament

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.140
Siming

00:08:55.149 --> 00:08:56.560
Go look for Xi

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.507
Yes

00:08:57.788 --> 00:09:00.087
Old Lady

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.280
This is bad

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:02.100
Master Xi

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.200
is missing

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.210
What?

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.357
We've searched everywhere from top to bottom, in and out

00:09:07.357 --> 00:09:08.980
But we still can't find him

00:09:08.993 --> 00:09:12.300
The staffs on shift duty saw Master Xi went out from back door

00:09:12.305 --> 00:09:13.320
Back door?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.520
Where is he going?

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.360
Did you find him?

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:19.960
No

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:20.540
And you?

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:21.800
Me neither

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:23.660
Where has the Master gone to?

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:24.860
I feel so nervous

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.770
How can Master Xi go missing?

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:28.300
Let's go over there to find

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.070
Go

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:31.660
Duanmu

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:32.910
is missing?

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.140
No

00:09:34.148 --> 00:09:35.539
Can't give up

00:09:35.539 --> 00:09:37.149
I must get out

00:09:37.149 --> 00:09:38.258
and find him

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.960
To tell him everything that's happening

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:50.180
Oh dear

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:52.400
This spirit is getting stronger

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.800
I can no longer control it

00:09:57.009 --> 00:09:58.364
Great grandma

00:09:58.364 --> 00:10:00.614
I have an urgent request from you

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:04.860
Please allow me to temporary take brother Xi's place to serve as a Yangming Master

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:07.340
and purify the evil spirit

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:08.240
But

00:10:08.805 --> 00:10:10.536
But you...

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:12.660
I have trained hard daily

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.680
My ability surely isn't far from him

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:17.820
but I have already learned the purification skill by heart

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:19.020
I have confidence

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:21.020
to purify this thing

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.630
I want you all to find the Master

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.920
But he's not at home

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:34.110
Then look again

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.100
If he isn't at home, search outside

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:39.060
I want to see him by daybreak

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.480
But the Master hasn't recovered yet

00:10:42.489 --> 00:10:44.085
As long as he's conscious,

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.160
carry him

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.320
I want you all to carry him back

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:53.460
The sun will rise after 1 hour

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.540
If he hasn't returned

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:57.480
It will be a disaster

00:10:57.480 --> 00:11:00.920
The rest is up to the Duamu family now

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:02.970
An hour's time

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.240
to you all

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:07.300
is more than enough, isn't it?

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:18.840
Damn, who stands in middle of the road at this hour?

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:21.180
Is he trying to freak me out?

00:11:25.005 --> 00:11:26.474
Situ Li

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.190
Duanmu Xi

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.830
Young Master

00:11:32.835 --> 00:11:34.915
It's been a while

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.050
Hey

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.040
Haven't you learned your lesson?

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:43.860
You still wanna cause trouble?

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.260
I've waited for hours

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.220
just to see you
